QuietCount uses networking, wallet, and deployment infrastructure adapted from
midnightntwrk/create-mn-app 0.5.1, copyright Midnight Foundation, Apache-2.0.
Source: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/create-mn-app
The original deployment template has been modified to supply private witnesses,
avoid recovery-phrase output, record public evidence, and preserve encrypted backups.
The contract and test suite are written for QuietCount. Runtime simulation patterns
follow Midnight's Apache-2.0 example-counter and example-bboard repositories.
